 "parte": 5,
 "anterior": "CL039",
 "titulo": "He could not escape one hand 🐒 Sun Wukong Part 5 #story #shorts",
 "capa": "ONE HAND",
 "descripcion": "The Buddha offers Sun Wukong a simple bet: jump out of my hand and Heaven is yours. Five hundred years later, a monk climbs a mountain.\n\nThe end of Sun Wukong: The Monkey King.\nWould you have taken the bet?\n\nFrom Journey to the West (Xiyouji), Wu Cheng'en, 16th century, chapters 7, 8 and 14.\n#monkeyking #sunwukong #journeytothewest #mythology #shorts",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Imagine a hand that a flying monkey *cannot leave*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Heaven calls the *Buddha*, who comes alone.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Let us bet, he says. Jump out of my hand.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "If you can, Heaven is yours.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Wukong laughs. The hand is so small.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "With one somersault, he flies to the end of the world.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He sees *five pink pillars* in the clouds.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He writes, *the Great Sage was here*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Like a true monkey, he pees on it, and flies back.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Give me Heaven, he says.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because now he loses everything.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "On the Buddha's finger are *Wukong's own words*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The pillars were *fingers*. He never left.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "The hand becomes a mountain, and falls on him.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "For *five hundred years*, only his head sticks out.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He eats iron pellets, and nobody comes.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Until a monk, *Tang Sanzang*, climbs the mountain.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "He pulls off the seal, and the monkey is *free*.",
   "pausa": 0.6
  },
  {
   "texto": "Would you trust a monkey from a stone that listened to the sky?",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
